    // Enter key, and its comment asserted "Deploy only ever happens via the
    // explicit button" — which was false.
    //
    // Real incident, 2026-07-26 QA (reproduced five times, five servers created
    // and five wallet debits taken): clicking "Continue →" on the Access step
    // placed the order outright, at the default monthly term, four steps before
    // the customer ever saw a price or a Review screen. The Continue and Deploy
    // buttons were two branches of an unkeyed ternary at the same position in
